# What scripts/export_l2_model.py needs in scripts/l2-builder/Containerfile,
# the image each trained model is exported in. Compiled with
# hashes into l2-export-requirements.txt; regenerate with the command in its
# header.
#
# transformers stays on 4.57.x, not the pod's 5.x: optimum-onnx caps it there,
# and 4.57.6 is what exported the shipped model (its config.json). Resolving
# with 5.x only succeeds by falling back to optimum 1.17, which predates it.
torch
optimum[onnxruntime]
transformers==4.57.6
sentencepiece
